# Template for the frontend production settings (`npm run build`, e.g. the GitHub Pages workflow).
# Written without the leading dot; the owner renames it (see deployment.md, "Rename after generation").
# Placeholder values only. Never put a secret in a VITE_* variable: Vite copies every VITE_* value into the public bundle.

# Public, not a secret. The public HTTPS URL of the deployed backend. No trailing slash.
VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.example.com

# Public, not a secret. The GitHub Pages project sub-path: "/" plus the repository name plus "/".
# Use "/" for a user site or a custom domain at the root.
VITE_BASE_PATH=/your-repository-name/
